nit of self-supported tactical agents, is activated. Leading seemingly ordinary lives among us, Division agents are trained to operate independently in order to save society. When society falls, your mission begins.", "summary": "Tom Clancy\u2019s The Division is a revolutionary experience that combines robust RPG customization with tactical action combat. There\u2019s never been a better time to jump in and join the fight to save NYC.\n\nJoin other agents to combat the outbreak in Manhattan across a wide-range of story missions and open-world activities.\n\nEnter the Dark Zone to earn high-level gear and face off against other players. Just be sure to watch your back.\n\nCustomize your agent, get cutting-edge gear, build a unique arsenal to gain an edge on Manhattan\u2019s deadliest inhabitants.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/tom-clancy-s-the-division", "videos": [{"id": 6817, "name": "Agent Origins Master Trailer", "video_id": "ABhGxOEQy8s", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ABhGxOEQy8s", "title": "Tom Clancy's The Division - Agent Origins Master Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ABhGxOEQy8s/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 4517, "name": "Commented Walkthrough", "video_id": "HCFPNqqjLaU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCFPNqqjLaU", "title": "Tom Clancy's The Division - E3 Commented Walkthrough (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HCFPNqqjLaU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 6687, "name": "Agent Journey", "video_id": "QD8wItASbiY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QD8wItASbiY", "title": "Tom Clancy's The Division - Agent Journey (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QD8wItASbiY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 7162, "name": "Collapse Trailer", "video_id": "gIa9AxG2zrI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g